          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court\u2019s answer will determine whether the $4\u202fmillion refund belongs to the bankruptcy estate under state property law or under the federal Bob Richards rule."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "2d3c9def0f46f4396731888707f6de6f68a64de341e4c3661dce33166ec2e62b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2d3c9def0f46-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          },
          {
            "document_hash": "2d3c9def0f46f4396731888707f6de6f68a64de341e4c3661dce33166ec2e62b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-2d3c9def0f46-0000-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner, a ruling in favor of state law would reinforce the traditional role of states in governing property\u2011rights disputes, while a ruling for the Bob Richards rule would affirm a long\u2011standing federal common\u2011law presumption."
      }
